# 🚀 AI Job Automation Platform — Full Task & Feature List

# Task 1 — Signup Flow using Nylas + Google

## Features

* Signup using Google via Nylas
* Store Nylas User ID
* Store Grant ID
* Auto-fill:

  * Full Name
  * Email
* User manually fills:

  * Phone Number
  * New Password
  * Confirm Password
* Validate password match
* Save user data in database

